  "statement_html": "<script>\tjQuery(function(){\t  jQuery(\"table.answeranalysis td\").css('text-align', 'left');\t  });\t</script>\t<div class=\"euler_quest\">\t <div class=\"grid-x grid-margin-x\">\t  <div class=\"cell small-12 medium-6\">\t   <div>\t    <p class=\"quest\">\t     Cet exercice comporte trois étapes.\t     <br>\t         </p>\t    <p>Une unité de longueur est donnée.\t<br class=\"spacer\">\tCRU est un triangle rectangle en C tel que <span class=\"nowrap\">CU = 2,3</span> et <span class=\"nowrap\">RU = 3,5.</span></p>\t    <p>On cherche à calculer une mesure de l'angle \\(\\widehat{CRU}\\)\tet de l'angle <span class=\"nowrap\">\\(\\widehat{CUR}\\).</span></p>\t   </div>\t  </div>\t  <div class=\"cell small-12 medium-6\">\t   <div class=\"pax-jsxgraph\" id=\"jsxbox\" data-w=\"500\" data-h=\"500\" data-maxw=\"500\" data-jsxgraph=\"jsxenonce,250 x 216,var brd = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(&#x27;jsxenonce&#x27;, {showCopyright : false,axis:false,boundingbox: [-2.7051611,1.5,3.5581676,-3.9161098],grid:false}); A=brd.create(&#x27;point&#x27;,[0,0],{name:&#x27;C&#x27;,face:&#x27;x&#x27;,size:3,color:&#x27;rgb(140,125,114)&#x27;,fixed:true,showInfobox:false,label:{fixed: false}});\tB=brd.create(&#x27;point&#x27;,[-1.2051611,-2.4161098],{name:&#x27;R&#x27;,face:&#x27;x&#x27;,size:3,color:&#x27;rgb(140,125,114)&#x27;,fixed:true,showInfobox:false,label:{fixed: false}});\tC=brd.create(&#x27;point&#x27;,[2.0581676,-1.0266188],{name:&#x27;U&#x27;,face:&#x27;x&#x27;,size:3,color:&#x27;rgb(140,125,114)&#x27;,fixed:true,showInfobox:false,label:{fixed: false}});\tbrd.create(&#x27;angle&#x27;,[B,A,C],{name:&#x27; &#x27;,radius:0.38333333,strokeColor:&#x27;black&#x27;,fillColor:&#x27;red&#x27;,fillOpacity:0.8});\tbrd.create(&#x27;polygon&#x27;,[A,B,C],{strokeColor: &#x27;black&#x27;,fillColor: &#x27;rgb(140,125,114)&#x27;,highlightfillColor:&#x27;rgb(140,125,114)&#x27;});\thypo=brd.create(&#x27;segment&#x27;,[B,C]);\tcat1=brd.create(&#x27;segment&#x27;,[A,B]);\tcat2=brd.create(&#x27;segment&#x27;,[A,C]);\"></div>\t  </div>\t  <div class=\"cell small-12  medium-6\">\t   <p class=\"quest\">Étape 1 - Sélectionner la ou les propositions qui conviennent.</p>\t  </div>\t </div>\t </div>\t<div class=\" euler_answer \">\t    <fieldset class=\"euler_field\">\t   <legend>Les égalités CU = 2,3 et RU = 3,5 permettent d'évaluer directement&nbsp;:</legend>\t    <ul class=\"wims_nopuce euler_ul_check\">\t      <li >\t         <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"1\" /> 3</label>        </li> <li >\t         <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"2\" /> 2</label>        </li> <li >\t         <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"3\" /> 1</label>        </li> <li >\t         <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"4\" /> 4</label>        </li> <li >\t         <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"5\" /> 5</label>        </li> <li >\t         <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"6\" /> 6</label>        </li>     </ul>\t  </fieldset>\t</div>\t ",
